      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay, so even if it didn't fully happen, the intentions and the arguments used to defend it were still a big deal. if you ignore the \"what ifs\" for a second and just look at the economic theory behind it—wasn't the whole point of the TPP to create more growth and cheaper goods through free trade? isn't that objectively better for the economy in the long run compared to being protectionist?",
      "source": "evaluator"
